  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Study visit Egyptian politicians on Dutch democratic governance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project concerns the dialogue on democratic governance from Dutch to Egyptian parliamentarians, party leaders and Members of the National Council for Human Rights.This project will achieve the following objectives:&#x2022;	High-level delegations from both countries are able to hold direct discussions and meetings on pressing domestic, regional and international issues. This new cooperation will build trust between the Egyptian and Dutch Parliament.&#x2022;	Exchange of expertise on the Dutch party system and democracy model and sharing lessons learned between the Netherlands and Egypt.&#x2022;	Empowerment of Egyptian political parties on topics related to the content of the study visit.</narrative>
  </description>
